    "project": "research/general_two_step_collision_audit_20261114/lean",
    "theorem": "GeneralTwoStepCollisionAudit.general_degree_two_collision_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem general_degree_two_collision_certificate : ∀ (G I : Type*) [AddCommGroup G] [Fintype G] [Fintype I] [DecidableEq G] [DecidableEq I] (p : I → ℝ) (hp0 : ∀ i, 0 ≤ p i) (hp : ∑ i, p i = 1) (g : I → G), TwoStepCollisionAudit.DegreeTwoGeneric g → (∀ v : G, expectation p (fun h : Hash G I => pairCount g h v) = 1 - TwoStepCollisionAudit.secondMoment p - (TwoStepCollisionAudit.secondMoment p)^2 + TwoStepCollisionAudit.fourthMoment p) ∧ (∀ z : JointSample G I, (jointLaw p hp0 hp z).toReal = (∏ x : G, p (z.1 x)) / (Fintype.card G : ℝ)^2) ∧ (jointLaw p hp0 hp).toOuterMeasure (freshEvent g : Set (JointSample G I)) = ENNReal.ofReal ((1 - TwoStepCollisionAudit.secondMoment p - (TwoStepCollisionAudit.secondMoment p)^2 + TwoStepCollisionAudit.fourthMoment p) / Fintype.card G)",
    "decl_sha256": "5802fbd3152989fdd4805235c86098686c69810ad95be92dadfca6606495d47c",
    "scope": "General exact actual finite-group degree-two local collision probability for every finite additive commutative group, finite label type, nonnegative normalized label law and actual increment table satisfying the literal source degree0/1/2genericity modulo commutativity. Derives actual terminal-preimage query injectivity iff source label admissibility; constructs actual fresh-pair↔admissible-label/hash-agreement equivalence with both inverses proved. The unchanged generic actual cylinder law and weighted label identity give fixed-terminal expected fresh-pair count1−I2−I2²+I4. Unique actual terminal decomposition gives global expected count groupcard×coefficient. Constructs genuine joint PMF from actual independent static vertex-label product law and independent uniform ordered starts (with replacement), derives real pointmass productlabelweights/groupcard², and proves actual fresh-event outermeasure=ofReal((1−I2−I2²+I4)/groupcard). Fresh event requires four queried states x,Fx,y,Fy distinct and F²x=F²y. No query-independence/count/coefficient/probability conclusion is supplied as a premise. Source conditions are actual increment equations, retained unchanged from prior source-qualified finite test. Closes prior general actual-group local coefficient gap, reuses unchanged generic cylinder/label proofs and credits known Bernstein–Lange2013 finite local collision calculation. No novelty or qualified-source refutation. Does not prove limiting firstcollision penalty/constants, higher-degree asymptotic correction or practical fixed/keyedhash refinement. Independent native written-header check is procedural, not kernel parser/hash/execution refinement. Standard foundations/defaults; no holes/custom axioms/native proof evaluation/global flags/raised limits/waivers/new cryptographic experiment/paid compute/agent upload.",
